tarski was cut, with its history, from the datalog package of Shearline
(https://github.com/mattjoyce/shearline, commit c4f75ab), which had been cut
from Anam's query engine (https://github.com/mattjoyce/anam). Its exact decimal
numbers and builtin table were ported from Anam (origin/master 45e4a67). Both
projects are by the same author and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

testdata/anam.dl is copied unchanged from Anam's internal/query/rules/anam.dl
at 45e4a67. testdata/rbac.dl is copied unchanged from Shearline's
policy/rbac.dl at c4f75ab. testdata/rbac_unseeded.dl is derived from rbac.dl
(the request seeds removed) for the demand benchmarks. All three are under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. They are test fixtures, not part of the module's
API.
